[Unit]
Description=Gravia sim doctor: 每 3 天自動體檢模擬盤所有策略，調整停損／放寬條件／移除沒救的變體（不經過 TG）
After=network-online.target gravia.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=ubuntu
WorkingDirectory=/home/ubuntu/gravia_live
EnvironmentFile=/home/ubuntu/gravia_live/.env
ExecStart=/home/ubuntu/venv/bin/python /home/ubuntu/gravia_live/polymarket_sim_doctor.py
TimeoutStartSec=1800
